OL,3,GNEWSASocial enterprise's 'most
OL,4,Aambitious venue to date'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFounders of a social enterprise who
OL,7,Fwork with former prisoners have
OL,8,Fdescribed the opening of their latest
OL,9,Fvenue as "the culmination" of its work
OL,10,Fover the last decade.
OL,12,FTap Social Movement based in Oxford has
OL,13,FDay Release at a new #14m social and
OL,14,Fretail space at Milton Park, a science
OL,15,Fand technology business hub, near
OL,16,FDidcot.
OL,18,FThe cafe and bar brings together Tap
OL,19,FSocial's bakery, pizza kitchen, cafe,
OL,20,Fbar, brewing school and events under
OL,21,Fone roof for the first time.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
