OL,3,GNEWSASocial enterprise's 'most
OL,4,Aambitious venue to date'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe social enterprise said it continued
OL,7,Fits mission to "create meaningful
OL,8,Femployment opportunities for people
OL,9,Fwith lived experience of the criminal
OL,10,Fjustice system, while creating a
OL,11,Fwelcoming place for everyone".
